# The key bindings: x added to Down (taken from the action that had it), shown changed with its default keys.
size 60 20
file README.md # Hello\n
file notes.md text\n
dir src
file src/main.rs fn main() {}\n
state settings.json {"glyphs":"unicode","theme":"dark","updateCheck":false,"follow":false}
start
keys , end up enter
keys down enter
keys x
until 2800
